{
  "label": "tsuneyofirsthall",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label tsuneyofirsthall:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall1.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey Tsuneyo. What are you doing?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "No response.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Is she looking at the board or something?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I glance over Tsuneyo’s shoulder to see if there’s a flyer for...noodles or something, but everything up there seems to be normal.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello? Earth to Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you ever just...think about whales?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not really, no.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall2.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you know that the life expectancy of the blue whale is anywhere from 80-90 years?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Though, there are some cases in which whales have lived for much longer.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thank you for this information that I will likely never use again.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall3.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re welcome.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...what are you up to tonight?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thinking about whales.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I see that. What else are you up to?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Talking about whales?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What I’m asking is if you have any plans.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t have anything to do, so I wanted to see if you’d be down to hang out for a bit.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall3.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In the hallway?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It doesn’t have to be the hallway. We could go to your room if you’d like.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think I’d prefer the hallway.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Being alone in a room with a boy is something I’m supposed to avoid.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if tsuneyodorm5 == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I’ve been in your room before.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, because it would have been rude for me to deny you entry.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right now, we are already in the hallway. So I just won’t go back in my room.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We can talk out here.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, so I’ll never be allowed in?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You probably will.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I tend to cave under pressure.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's whatever. I'm fine with talking in the hallway, I guess.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just prefer a topic slightly more interesting than the amount of time whales live.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can probably manage that.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall5.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Have you met Noodles?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We literally named him together, Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall6.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall7.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m surprised he’s still up there. How does a bird even get into the dorms?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Perhaps he is enrolled at the[school]?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How would a bird even enroll?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s crazy what you can do with a computer nowadays.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He literally does not have hands. He can’t type.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, he doesn’t know how to read either. This entire topic is flawed.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I had no idea you hated birds so much.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What did Noodles ever do to you?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t hate birds. I just don’t think-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You just don’t think they should be allowed to attend[school] like the rest of us.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, that’s-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Actually. Yes, that’s right.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodles, attack.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caw!",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, he actually makes noise.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s not all he can do.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is that supposed to-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall10.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caw!",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What the fuck?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where did it get such a small knife?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do not ask questions you are afraid to hear the answers to.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You gave the bird a knife, didn’t you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I couldn’t just say no to him.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He asked you for one?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I thought maybe he wanted to learn how to prepare dinner for his family.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He doesn’t have a family, though. He would have gone back to them already.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Perhaps he is just a horrible parent?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If birds are able to attend[school], it is also possible that they, too, struggle with certain family values from time to time.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They...can’t attend[school], though. How did we get back to this?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodles, attack.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caw!",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodles, don’t attack.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why does he only respond to you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He is thankful that I provided him the tools he needs to prepare dinner for his family.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you’re going to go with that dinner excuse, you’re going to need to tell him to stop attacking me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t force Noodles into a life of murder.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What is my life becoming?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why am I arguing with a [teenage]girl about birds when there are several others I can think of off the top of my head that would have sex with me?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall10.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caw! (Perhaps it’s because you’ve become too complacent with your current life and are just looking for that “chase” once again.)",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caw! Caw! (Or perhaps you find comfort in knowing that there is someone with a fresh view of not only you, but of everything.)",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caaaaw! (A worldview untainted by the evils of man. Just a girl with a passion for her craft and not a care in the world about romance.)",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall11.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caw! (Or perhaps you just want to return things to how they should be?)",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, I think it might be time for me to leave.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Already? Why?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m beginning to think the bird is talking to me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But he is talking to you.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I taught Noodles about existentialism.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...How?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caw!",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you are leaving, would you mind if I asked you a question first?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure, whatever. What is it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s kind of personal, so I apologize if this crosses any lines.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just ask the question, Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall12.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay. Well...here goes.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
